description: NixOS vs Home Manager boundaries in this flake
globs: nixos/**/*.nix
alwaysApply: false
---

# Nix layout

- `nixos/modules/` — system services (PipeWire, network, keyboard module, `programs.niri` enable).
- `nixos/home/programs/` — per-app home-manager modules; add new GUI/cli here.
- `nixos/home/build-packages/` — custom packages; use `callPackage` from programs.
- `shared.nix` picks `nixos.nix` when `isNixOS = true` (embedded in flake) vs standalone `homeConfigurations`.
- Prefer extending existing `imports` lists over new top-level flake outputs unless adding a new machine.

Tell the user to rebuild when needed (`#hp-notebook`); do not run `nh` / `nixos-rebuild` / `home-manager switch` unless they ask.
